    <briefdescription>
<para>CRYSTALS-Dilithium digital signature scheme. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>NIST-approved post-quantum signature algorithm (FIPS 204 / ML-DSA). Suitable for document signing, code signing, and CMS/PKCS#7 operations.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This implementation uses an OpenSSL-backed software simulation (Ed25519) that is API-compatible with the full liboqs backend. Once liboqs is available the backend will be replaced transparently. The simulation is labeled DILITHIUM_SIM in diagnostic output.</para>
</simplesect>
Security levels: DILITHIUM_2 – 128-bit quantum security DILITHIUM_3 – 192-bit quantum security DILITHIUM_5 – 256-bit quantum security ← recommended</para>
<para>Thread safety: all methods are thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
